{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If a diagonal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rectangle\" title=\"Rectangle\">rectangle</a> forms a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/f/29fa0a9949f018e121b2093216dd5db13d3abef0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Angle\" title=\"Angle\">angle</a> with one of its sides, then the area of the rectangle is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/4/b04388489b789d2b4a6fe1520d8ae181185cb8f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } \\frac{d^2 \\sqrt{3}}{4}\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } \\frac{d^2}{2}\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 2d^2\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } d^2 \\sqrt{2}\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\mathrm{None\\;of\\;these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"537\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c78b85058ee5e17f88e2cde302e48aad826b35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30-60-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">right triangle</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ratio\" title=\"Ratio\">ratios</a>, the lengths of the sides of the rectangle are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/4/0049275faba66d1146c7cab42dc026f0b71cee89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/5/ae5784956455385b9819efcec5eee2c7c0173779.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{d\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"40\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>The area of the rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/e/43e70eac38ce6dc0d0534048b5c1d98b3572153f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{d^2\\sqrt{3}}{4}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by